    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 25,
    "summary": "Lamanite aggressions spread—The seed of the priests of Noah perish as Abinadi prophesied—Many Lamanites are converted and join the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi—They believe in Christ and keep the law of Moses. About 90–77 B.C.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
