        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "And now Abinadi was the first that suffered death by fire because of his belief in God; now this is what he meant, that many should suffer death by fire, according as he had suffered.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "Mosiah 17:13 (13–20)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 25:11",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And he said unto the priests of Noah that their seed should cause many to be put to death, in the like manner as he was, and that they should be scattered abroad and slain, even as a sheep having no shepherd is driven and slain by wild beasts; and now behold, these words were verified, for they were driven by the Lamanites, and they were hunted, and they were smitten.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 25:12",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that when the Lamanites saw that they could not overpower the Nephites they returned again to their own land; and many of them came over to dwell in the land of Ishmael and the land of Nephi, and did join themselves to the people of God, who were the people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 181,
            "end": 188,
            "text": "Alma 22:1 (1, 4)."
          },
          {
            "start": 281,
            "end": 296,
            "text": "Alma 24:1 (1–3, 5, 20); 27:21 (2, 21, 25)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 25:13",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 25,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
